Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,\N🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece by piece
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you're leaving me in pieces on display
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,for good
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,while I'm fine and understood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As I rattle my cell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm recomputing molecules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,in prison bars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot at my foot and not the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ain't that a shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My illness, a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've set yourself as queen and me as the pawn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A move to the right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're out of sight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that a pain? You're finally gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(oooh my god!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:01:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Recomputing, counting the hours
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,by their watching, waiting for years
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,while they're begging tearfully
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I really crying, shedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.94,0:01:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,letting somebody, anybody, use me for a utility?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Utilizing, realizing god made me for a shameful purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,worthless, notice why
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why am I still alive? 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that life isn't worth the stife anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put up a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've set yourself upright to be quite the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A move to the left
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all out of help
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't it a pain you reap what you sow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,(oooh my god)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece by piece
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving me in pieces on display
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,for good, while I'm fine and understood
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,a move to the left
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.76,0:01:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all out of help
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't it a pain you reap what you sow?
